  "title": "Tamiya",
  "slug": "tamiya",
  "summary": "Tamiya, also known as Ta'ameya, is an Egyptian version of falafel made with dried broad beans instead of chickpeas. These savory fritters are seasoned with herbs and spices, then deep-fried until golden.",
